    "answer": {
      "short": "Saskia earns the most.",
      "worked": "Compare annual earnings using 52 weeks, 26 fortnights and 12 months per year.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\text{Keira's annual pay} &= \\$2665\\times52=\\$138\\,580\\\\\n\\text{Katelyn's annual pay} &= \\$11\\,650\\times12=\\$139\\,800\\\\\n\\text{Isabella's weekly pay} &= \\$57\\times37=\\$2109\\\\\n\\text{Isabella's annual pay} &= \\$2109\\times52=\\$109\\,668\\\\\n\\text{Saskia's annual pay} &= \\$5888\\times26=\\$153\\,088\n\\end{align*}$$\nSaskia earns the most: \\$153 088 per year.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
